# TradingAgents Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values

# ============================================
# Google API Key (Required for free tier)
# ============================================
# Get your free key from: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-google-api-key-here

# ============================================
# OpenAI API Key (Optional - only if using OpenAI)
# ============================================
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# ============================================
# Anthropic API Key (Optional - only if using Claude)
# ============================================
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here

# ============================================
# Alpha Vantage API Key (Optional - only if using Alpha Vantage)
# ============================================
# ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=your-alpha-vantage-key-here

# ============================================
# Custom Configuration Paths (Optional)
# ============================================
# TRADINGAGENTS_RESULTS_DIR=./results
# TRADINGAGENTS_CACHE_DIR=./cache
# TRADINGAGENTS_DATA_DIR=./data

# ============================================
# Notes:
# ============================================
# - Only GOOGLE_API_KEY is required for free-tier usage
# - Get Google API key: https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
# - Google Gemini Pro is free with generous quotas (60 req/min)
# - Yahoo Finance requires no API key (completely free)
# - Load this file with: python-dotenv (already in requirements.txt)
#
# Usage in code:
#   from dotenv import load_dotenv
#   load_dotenv()
#
# Or export manually:
#   export $(cat .env | xargs)

